      "content": "thanks. i really feel like there's something there. if we're talking non-linear wave dynamics, i want to try to model the actual waveform for \"intent.\" if willpower is basically just the brain's ability to maintain a coherent state against external noise, could we treat that coherence as a standing wave? i'm trying to figure out what kind of frequency modulation (FM) would be required to disrupt or reinforce that coherence. can you help me work out a hypothetical formula that links a specific pitch frequency to a level of cognitive stability? something like f = (delta_intent / resonance_factor)?",
